      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To hide or show the note tree, press the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ button to the left of the first tab in the horizontal layout, or the __TRILIUM_PH_1__ button at the bottom of the __TRILIUM_PH_2__Launch Bar__TRILIUM_PH_3__ in the vertical layout. The __TRILIUM_PH_4__Toggle Left Pane__TRILIUM_PH_5__ __TRILIUM_PH_6__keyboard shortcut__TRILIUM_PH_7__, which is not assigned by default, does the same. See __TRILIUM_PH_8__Vertical and horizontal layout__TRILIUM_PH_9__.",
